oo). Adding or editing a product has an optional "KRA Item Class Code" with a suggestion from its name ("Use"); left empty, the product goes to KRA under the general code 99010000 until one is set, and changing it registers a registered product again. A product\'s sizes share its KRA code. eTIMS stock follows the system: opening stock at registration, goods received (02), stock adjustments and counts (06 in / 16 out), breakages, damage and expiry (15) and returns to a supplier (12) are sent by themselves once Live, and a sale short of eTIMS stock adds the shortfall first - do not also add stock on the KRA portal; Settings > eTIMS (eTIMS Setup) holds the KRA PIN, branch, DigiTax API key, Test Connection and Enable.'],
